{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方最大字号的主标题，首先注意到紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”和“不自在了呢”，随后视线可能落到中部灰白色大字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他担心有一天对方不再需要自己陪伴，甚至不再愿意自在地和自己相处。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、担忧。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他此刻忽然安静，但对方并没有退开，两人眼下仍然亲近；他也可能因为对方喜欢自己在身边而有一点高兴。这些现实情况和较积极的情绪需要看中下方文字才能获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题本身较长，需要读过条件句才能明确这是对未来关系变化的担忧，而不是对方现在已经疏远他。\",\n    \"主标题、中部灰白色大字、底部金色大字都很醒目，存在多个显眼文本块争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：主标题讲未来的担忧，中部讲眼下仍然亲近，底部讲可能的积极感受，需要拼接才能理解完整处境与感受之间的关系。\",\n    \"主标题中紫色放大的关键词能传达被需要与否的主题，但单独不足以说明这是怎样的心理处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "da56cab5-25e9-4b6a-ae0a-86c0293ba283", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021036565160Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:11:23.062321+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "786c9a50793ebff202bd0d2e8a34e0fbc45f80ff568fa0057964b530043b6733", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021036565160Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ce17c5fc369efa31bceadd3eaff6b3c8d9c01b3ca2dfb1886203ee6167560663"}}}
